// WMI Event Subscription Created
// Sigma rule: rules/sigma/windows/win_wmi_event_subscription.yml (8c68b8b0-118f-4dfe-bcb9-b8c6c8d2fa9d)
// Level: high. ATT&CK: T1546.003 Windows Management Instrumentation Event Subscription
// Generated by `python -m detlab build`. Change the Sigma rule, not this file.
any where winlog.channel:"Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" and ((event.code like~ ("19", "20", "21")) and winlog.event_data.Operation:"Created")
